Bundled model weights

Identra's installable builds ship an embedding model so that recall works by meaning on
first launch, offline. The weights are redistributed, not authored here:

  BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  Copyright (c) 2023 Beijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence (BAAI)
  Licensed under the MIT License.
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

  The ONNX conversion Identra fetches is Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5, the same artifact the
  fastembed crate downloads at runtime when a build ships without the model:
  https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5

The weights are not in this repository. They are fetched at build time by
apps/identra-desktop/fetch-model.sh and included in the bundle from there.
